{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/senior-salaries-review-body-remit-letter-2027-to-2028","content_id":"2cbd3012-bd60-4aa9-8d68-e4440b0803c4","description":"Letter about the pay round for the financial year 2027 to 2028 from the Secretary of State for Health and Social Care to the Senior Salaries Review Body.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9389345","isbn":"","title":"Senior Salaries Review Body remit letter: 2027 to 2028","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/senior-salaries-review-body-remit-letter-2027-to-2028/senior-salaries-review-body-remit-letter-2027-to-2028"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This letter to the Senior Salaries Review Body (<abbr title=\"Senior Salaries Review Body\">SSRB</abbr>) sets out the remit from the Department of Health and Social Care (<abbr title=\"Department of Health and Social Care\">DHSC</abbr>) to the <abbr title=\"Senior Salaries Review Body\">SSRB</abbr>.</p>\n\n<p>It concerns the pay round for the financial year 2027 to 2028.</p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-15T13:57:27Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["7cd6bf12-bbe9-4118-8523-f927b0442156","e3115d57-8ee5-4bbf-96e0-f167c8729a6e"],"featured_attachments":["9389345"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-15T14:57:27.000+01:00","political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-07-15T14:57:27+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/senior-salaries-review-body-remit-letter-2027-to-2028","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/senior-salaries-review-body-remit-letter-2027-to-2028","base_path":"/government/publications/senior-salaries-review-body-remit-letter-2027-to-2028","content_id":